# Repository

The only GitHub repository for this project is https://github.com/blofelds/acc-telemetry.

- `origin` is `blofelds/acc-telemetry`. Push, pull, and open pull requests only there.
- Do not fetch, pull, push, clone, or open issues or pull requests against `KubaC701/acc-telemetry`.
- Do not add a remote that points at `KubaC701/acc-telemetry`.
- If a command would contact that repository, stop and use `blofelds/acc-telemetry` instead.
